id: loose
name: Loose
kind: crafting
categories: combat-clothing, standard-clothing
slots: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Taken off - and its Doff Bonus had - through the No-Effort Maneuver.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: You can Doff this piece of Apparel through the No-Effort Maneuver.
text: >
  Loose: This item of clothing comes off quite easily.
  –Apparel Category: Combat Clothing/Standard Clothing
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: You can Doff this piece of Apparel through the No-Effort Maneuver.

---

# Taken off in a Combat Encounter: the No-Effort Maneuver instead of its Actions, on its
# wearer's turn and while they have its use this Round - asked where both are open. Its Doff
# Bonus as any piece's.

[passive]
piece.doffsWithNoEffort = true;
